{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/614090/extras/31bbcf9175a1ad66aa41e0fde3c92370.poster.avif?t=1757416470\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/614090/extras/31bbcf9175a1ad66aa41e0fde3c92370.webm?t=1757416470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/614090/extras/31bbcf9175a1ad66aa41e0fde3c92370.mp4?t=1757416470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>London\u2019s Super Heroes have been vanquished. Only the Deadbeat Heroes can put an end to dastardly evil-doers and their rotten plans!<br><br>Deadbeat Heroes is a movement based 3D brawler where you (and a friend) dodge bullets, steal super powers and crack wise. You play as the new wave of \u2018Deadbeat Heroes\u2019. Not born with their own powers, they are armed with a prototype super gauntlet - which has the ability to 'borrow' the powers of others. You will (both) vie to win the hearts of the public with your amazing daring do, while not getting shot, sliced, lasered, exploded, vaporized, eaten...<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Power Fists Forever \u2013 Choose from one of 10 explosive abilities including a rocket powered punch, freeze ray and invisibility<br></li><li>London\u2019s Streets \u2013 Over 35 levels set across London<br></li><li>Extreme Traversal \u2013 Wall Run &amp; Air Dash through London<br></li><li>Alone or with a Friend - 1 to 2 player local campaign co-op<br></li><li>Twitch Streaming \u2013 Chat appears in the news ticker, chatters become baddies and are featured in end of level credits<br></li><li>Groovy Baby - A groovy cell shaded aesthetic bringing 70\u2019s style to the 21st century<br></li><li>Bringing the Bass - A funky original soundtrack created by Pitstop Productions <br></li><li>Dulcet T